# <%= @module %>

<!-- One line: what this application does, and for whom. -->

<%= @section %>
## Getting started

You need PostgreSQL. The Erlang and Elixir versions are pinned in `.tool-versions`, which mise and
asdf both read.

```sh
mix setup
mix phx.server
```

The application listens on [localhost:<%= @web_port %>](http://localhost:<%= @web_port %>), and its
health endpoints on port <%= @health_port %>. `mix precommit` is the gate before a commit, and CI checks the project with `ehosctl verify`; how
the tests are written is in [TESTING.md](TESTING.md). Coding agents start at [AGENTS.md](AGENTS.md).
